lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/a4d90b39b4ec04fb594459912383d050.poster.avif?t=1732008563\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/a4d90b39b4ec04fb594459912383d050.webm?t=1732008563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/a4d90b39b4ec04fb594459912383d050.mp4?t=1732008563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/282f7b6449daa053841ec430cdaac4b3.webp?t=1732008563\" width=600 height=47 /></span>With highly synchronized online matching feature, Players are allowed to fight with others from web, Or simply </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >invite your friends from your<strong> Steam friend list </strong>and see who is a better fighter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/3fb5c5ed5f87a2d9a57b14057b00739d.avif?t=1732008563\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/717d2f5c9186b3bc9194131765207441.webp?t=1732008563\" width=600 height=47 /></span>Each animal (Character) all comes with unique design moves and super!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of curse, each awesome moves all have their advantage and weak spot, avoid smashing the same move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and find the right timing to smash your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/84089b4a6d6c06e918cabad16b8e9cd9.poster.avif?t=1732008563\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/84089b4a6d6c06e918cabad16b8e9cd9.webm?t=1732008563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160330/extras/84089b4a6d6c06e918cabad16b8e9cd9.mp4?t=1732008563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
